To ensure successful deployment, we suggest dividing the project into four phases: Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support. 

During the Inception & Design phase, we will work closely with the client to define the project scope, identify key stakeholders, and develop a detailed project plan. This phase will also include the design of the intelligent assistance tool and the development of a change management strategy.

The Pilot / MVP phase will involve deploying the solution on a limited scope to test its functionality and gather feedback from the agents. This phase is crucial in identifying and addressing any technical or operational issues before proceeding with the full rollout.

The Full Rollout phase will involve deploying the solution to the entirety of the services, providing accompaniment to change and training for the agents. Our dedicated change manager will work closely with the client to ensure a smooth transition and minimize disruption to their operations.

Finally, the Operations & Support phase will focus on ensuring the long-term sustainability of the solution, providing ongoing maintenance and support, and monitoring the solution's performance to identify areas for improvement.

In terms of key milestones, we can expect the following: completion of the pilot phase, successful deployment of the full rollout, achievement of the desired level of user adoption, and realization of the expected benefits.

As for risks, we have identified several potential risks, including technical issues, resistance to change from the agents, and delays in the project timeline. To mitigate these risks, we will maintain a risk register, review it bi-weekly, and develop contingency plans to address any potential issues that may arise.

Our team of certified project managers, including PMP and PRINCE2 Practitioner certified professionals, will work closely with the client to ensure that the project is delivered on time, within budget, and to the required quality standards. We are confident that our experience in managing large-scale public sector IT projects, combined with our expertise in AI solutions and change management, makes us well-suited to deliver this project successfully.
